    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "NC.-\n25628\nUS MAIL\nAR EXPRESS\naUTHERN\nCHICAGO AND SOUTHERN AIRLINER",
      "Chicago and Southern\nAir Lines\n• • • great huge planes that fly \"The Valley Level Route\" are, in\nthemselves.\ntestimony of the tremendous advance and high per-\nfection of air transportation. C. \u0026 S. Douglas Dixieliners fly more\nthan 12.000 miles each day throughout Middle America, providing\nimproved day and night service from Chicago to New Orleans and\nHouston with splendid connections from principal cities of the\nSouth, Southwest.\nNorth and\nNortheast.\nC. \u0026 S. Dixieliners will\nsoon fly from Memphis to Detroit via Paducah, Evansville, Indian-\napolis. Anderson, Muncie, New Castle, Marion. Fort Wayne and\nToledo, a new\nservice destined to become a segment of postwar\ninternational north-south traffic.\nзитво\nPost Card\n3с\nSTAMP\nU.S.A.\nPOSTAGE\nJUMBO POST CARD CO.—SAN ANTONIO. TEXAS\nTRAGDARST\nDELINER\nThe ENEMY is listening-Don't SAY it.\nThe ENEMY can READ-Don't WRITE it.\n2015.166.2515"
    ],
